  'line.corvin.pitch': '« Skills are bought with coin or with sweat. Mine cost coin, and they are worth it. »',
  'line.corvin.night': '« The school is shut. Come back with the light. »',
  'line.corvin.rich': '« A champion\'s purse, and still no Whirlwind? Let me fix that. »',
  // journal Passe DB13 (the operator's DB11-5 « Le dire partout »): Ren's own stats on the match sheet, and where his health comes from
