  // the generic fighters and the two of the pool met on the training ground after the cut (lot L2b), « proposé »
  'v2.line.aldric': '« One strap, and the qualifiers were over for me. I still drill: a bout on the sand, if you have the stake. »',
  'v2.line.aldric.hauberk': '« That is my hauberk you wear. Mother chose well. A bout on the sand, if you have the stake? »',
  'v2.line.corra': '« A staff for hire, a coin a blow. Or a bout on the sand, if you have the stake. »',
  'v2.line.corra.reprisal': '« {name} sent me: you took what was theirs. Pay me {n} coins, or meet me on the sand. »',
  'v2.line.ambrose': '« I lost the shrine\'s purse in the qualifiers. A friendly bout pays for lamp oil, if you have the stake. »',
  'v2.line.lucan': '« Marek put me out of the qualifiers in four blows. I drill every evening until it takes him five. A bout on the sand, if you have the stake. »',
  'v2.line.piers': '« The river traders pay me to watch their barges until the crown is won. A bout on the sand keeps the spear awake, if you have the stake. »',
  'v2.line.kell': '« No blade, no armour: these two fists are all I brought. A few coins on the sand, if you have the stake. »',
  'v2.line.tobin.in': '« Wish me luck: I am still in it! »',
  'v2.line.tobin.out': '« Out of the crown. But I can still beat someone, can\'t I? A bout? »',
  'v2.line.rhosk.in': '« The crown first. Talk after. »',
  'v2.line.rhosk.out': '« No contract from the crown, then. A bout for coin will do. »',
