  'v2.line.odo.signed': '« You are on the roll. Bouts at the afternoon bell on days two, four and five, then the cut. A defeat in the pool costs points, not your place. »',
  'v2.line.odo.bracket': '« The pool is closed. Four on the road to the crown, four at the Gate: everyone fights again. »',
