  'v2.scout.habit.vessa': 'she darts in with a lunge, slips out of reach, and quickens her tempo when the bout turns',
  'v2.scout.habit.marek': 'he winds up his great blow for an age, shuts himself up like a gate when pressed, and grows heavier as the bout goes on',
  'v2.scout.habit.orla': 'she drives her shoulder in after every heavy swing, and plants her feet like a quay post',
  'v2.scout.habit.ilse': 'her blows fall slow and true; she prays between them, and her guard hardly drops',
  'v2.scout.habit.cassius': 'behind the hall\'s stage he lets his fencing master strike first and answers with a gilded riposte; his house\'s colours make him bold',
  'v2.scout.habit.rhosk': 'his axe comes late and terrible; he roars to warm himself, and shrugs off blows in his bearskin',
  'v2.scout.habit.tobin': 'he swings wild and wide, falls, and gets up every time',
