  'v2.line.ilse.respect': '« You fought clean, and you won. The Temple honours that, and so do I. »',
  'v2.line.ilse.friend': '« You have been a friend to me. If something stirs against you, the wardens tell me, and I will tell you. »',
  'v2.line.tobin.respect': '« You beat me and you did not laugh. My father says that is how you know a real knight. »',
  'v2.line.tobin.friend': '« You are the best of them all! If I hear anything, anything at all, I will run and tell you. »',
  'v2.line.rhosk.respect': '« You hit hard, for a southerner. I remember who hits hard. »',
  'v2.line.marek.friend': '« You have my word: if someone means you harm before the bell, I will say so. A title won by tricks is not worth the iron. »',
