  'v2.lie.unknown': 'You would need to know who paid for the taverns\' tale.',
  'v2.lie.confronted': 'You have said it to her face already.',
  'v2.lie.confrontLog': 'Before the forecourt\'s crowd you tell Vessa Lark what she paid Lio\'s room to say of {name}. She laughs, but the river duelists look away: by dusk the tale is dead.',
  'v2.lie.confrontLogPast': 'Before the forecourt\'s crowd you tell Vessa Lark what she paid Lio\'s room to say. She laughs, but the river duelists look away.',
  'v2.line.vessa.confronted': '« So you heard what was said at Lio\'s. The taverns believe what they like. Go and win your bouts, then. »',
  'v2.line.ambrose.tale': '« I light the square\'s lamps at dusk, and I hear things. Vessa Lark bought every round at Lio\'s and told each table the same tale of {name}: hurt, and rusty. »',
  'v2.line.ambrose.taleOld': '« Vessa Lark bought the rounds at Lio\'s once, to tell a tale of {name}. Lamp oil is dear; lies are cheap. »',
  'v2.seen.rounds': 'paid for every round at Lio\'s',
  'v2.sand.rhosk': 'Rhosk the Northman stands on the sand you drill on, and none of Brann\'s recruits will cross him. Orla still spars; a challenge won, or a word to Sergeant Hale, would clear it.',
  'v2.sand.brawl': 'Sergeant Brann keeps the sand shut until noon: the barracks brawled last night, and the benches are in pieces. Orla still spars.',
  'v2.sand.reportLabel': 'Tell Sergeant Hale that Rhosk means to bar the training sand',
  'v2.sand.unknown': 'Hale has nothing to act on.',
  'v2.sand.cleared': 'The training sand is clear of Rhosk already.',
  'v2.sand.reportLog': 'Sergeant Hale sends a runner to Clerk Odo: a fighter who bars the lists\' sand to another breaks the tournament\'s peace. Rhosk has his warning, and the sand is yours.',
  'v2.sand.challengeLog': 'Rhosk wipes his axe and steps back: « You stand. The sand is yours. »',
  'v2.line.rhosk.sand': '« The sand belongs to who stands on it. Today, that is me. »',
  'v2.line.rhosk.warned': '« The registrar\'s runner came. The sand is yours. For now. »',
  'v2.line.corra.rhosk': '« The Northman wanted my staff beside his axe on the training sand, to keep you off it. I fight for coin, not for that. »',
  'v2.line.hale.rhosk': '« Rhosk means to bar the training sand to you? Say the word and I send a runner to the registrar. »',
  'v2.line.hale.rhoskLedger': '« Rhosk\'s name is in my ledger now, beside the sand he wanted. »',
  'v2.line.drill.rhosk': '« The Northman has taken my sand since dawn. My recruits will not drill near him, and I cannot blame them. »',
  'v2.line.drill.brawlShut': '« Half my recruits have black eyes this morning: the barracks brawled last night, and the sand stays shut till noon while we clear the broken benches. Come back after the bells, or spar with Orla. »',
  'v2.line.drill.roar': '« Hear that? The Colosseum. Somebody is being carried off the sand. Drill harder. »',
  'v2.heal.busy': 'Sister Anwen is busy with the fighter hurt in today\'s bouts: her care waits for the morning. Rest, or a salve, will do tonight.',
  'v2.line.anwen.busy': '« Not tonight: a fighter of the pool came off the sand bleeding, and every cot is taken. Come at first light. »',
  'v2.line.mara.regular': '« You again! For a regular, 10 % off, as always. »',
  'v2.line.mara.sore': '« I remember your face. Keep your hands where I can see them. »',
  'v2.line.hilde.regular': '« My best customer. 10 % off, and ask me to look at your buckles before a bout. »',
  'v2.line.hilde.sore': '« I know what you did. Pay first, then we talk. »',
  'v2.line.pip.regular': '« My favourite customer! 10 % off, because I like your face. »',
  'v2.line.pip.sore': '« Not you again. Everything is nailed down. »',
  'v2.line.corvin.regular': '« A student who comes back. Good: 10 % off my gear for the ones who come back. »',
  'v2.line.corvin.sore': '« I teach fighters, not thieves. Coin first. »',
  'v2.line.pip.market1': '« The night market is open! Lanterns, ribbons, and luck by the ounce, all round the stage. »',
  'v2.line.pip.market2': '« Paper lanterns on every rope tonight: the whole square comes to the night market. Buy before they do. »',
  'v2.line.pip.market3': '« The night market again, and the crowd thicker than yesterday. Good for trade, bad for purses: mind yours. »',
  'v2.line.bard.puppetsWon1': '« The puppeteers played your bout against {foe} this afternoon. Your puppet has a bigger sword and a better hat. »',
  'v2.line.bard.puppetsWon2': '« Did you see the puppets? {foe} falls in three acts, and you take a bow in the fourth. The children cheered. »',
  'v2.line.bard.puppetsLost1': '« The puppeteers played {foe}\'s win today. Your puppet loses its hat, but it gets up. I liked that part. »',
  'v2.line.bard.puppetsLost2': '« The puppets had {foe} beat you with a wooden spoon. The crowd laughed, then went quiet. They want you back, {name}. »',
  'v2.why.confrontVessa': 'your words to Vessa Lark',
  'v2.why.reportRhosk': 'your word to Hale about Rhosk',
  // lot L5 (EV-12 « Les places lisent le pouls, la célébrité compte »): the watch at a robbed stall, the passers-by who greet or whisper, the rivals' gestures
  'v2.steal.watched': 'Wynn of the watch stands by {name}\'s stall today, after the theft: not a chance.',
  'v2.line.wynn.posted': '« Sergeant Hale has me by {name}\'s stall today, after what happened. Move along, unless you are buying. »',
  'v2.line.hale.posted': '« Wynn stands by {name}\'s stall today. A stall robbed once is a stall robbed twice, if nobody watches it. »',
  'v2.line.hale.thinDay': '« We\'re stretched thin, with the crowds. If something happens after dark, I\'ll hear of it too late. »',
  'v2.line.folk.unknown': '« Another fighter for the pool? The heralds have not cried your name yet. »',
  'v2.line.folk.noticed': '« You are the one from the pool, aren\'t you? My cousin put a coin on you. »',
  'v2.line.folk.known': '« {name}! The whole town talks of you, and of your next bout. »',
  'v2.line.folk.celebrated': '« {name}, here? Wait till I tell my sister. The puppeteers play you every afternoon! »',
  'v2.line.folk.wary': '« I have nothing worth taking, friend. Sergeant Hale has your name, they say. »',
  'v2.line.folk.wanted': '« The watch is looking for you. I did not see you, all right? »',
  'v2.hail.noticed1': '« Isn\'t that one of the pool? »',
  'v2.hail.noticed2': '« Good luck, {name}! »',
  'v2.hail.known1': '« {name}! Good day to you! »',
  'v2.hail.known2': '« There goes {name}, of the pool! »',
  'v2.hail.celebrated1': '« Make way for {name}! »',
  'v2.hail.celebrated2': '« {name}! A word for my son? »',
  'v2.hail.won1': '« I saw you beat {foe}! »',
  'v2.hail.won2': '« What a bout, {name}! »',
  'v2.hail.lost1': '« Chin up, {name}! »',
  'v2.hail.lost2': '« {foe} was lucky, that is all. »',
  'v2.hail.boutToday': '« Good luck on the sand today! »',
  'v2.hail.boutToday2': '« I will be on the stands, {name}! »',
  'v2.hail.bets': '« Half the Cité has a coin on you today! »',
  'v2.hail.tomorrow1': '« Tomorrow, {name}! Against {next}! »',
  'v2.hail.tomorrow2': '« Rest well tonight, {name}! »',
  'v2.hail.final1': '« Bring the crown home, {name}! »',
  'v2.hail.final2': '« The final! Beat {next} for us! »',
  'v2.hail.champion1': '« Hail the champion! »',
  'v2.hail.champion2': '« {name}, champion of the Cité! »',
  'v2.hail.whisper1': '« That is the one in Hale\'s ledger. »',
  'v2.hail.whisper2': '« Mind your purse, here comes one. »',
  'v2.hail.avoid1': '« Don\'t look. The watch wants that one. »',
  'v2.hail.avoid2': '« Step aside, quick. »',
  'v2.gesture.friend': '{name} raises a hand to you.',
  'v2.gesture.respect': '{name} gives you a nod.',
  'v2.gesture.grudge': '{name} turns away from you.',

