  'v2.passer.yselle.soft': 'Ask her for the song of the champion\'s gate ({pct} %)',
  'v2.passer.yselle.won': 'Yselle sings it to the last verse, then hands you {item} for {price} coins.',
  'v2.passer.garrick.soft': 'Ask what he would have done against Marek ({pct} %)',
  'v2.passer.garrick.won': 'Garrick talks until the drill master glares at you both: {item}, for {price} coins, « and keep your chin down ».',
  'v2.passer.maud.soft': 'Help her water the horses ({pct} %)',
  'v2.passer.maud.won': 'Maud wipes her hands: « You have a way with the grey. » {item}, for {price} coins.',
